{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03942","headline":"奉和送金城公主适西蕃应制 · 李适","name":"奉和送金城公主适西蕃应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绦河从远聘，青海赴和亲。\n月作临边晓，花爲度陇春。\n主歌悲顾鹤，帝策重安人。\n独有琼箫去，悠悠思锦轮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03942.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03942","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}